  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance on Social Protection and Social Services for UK Loan Guarantees</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding for technical assistance has been provisioned for under UESP to support wider UK development priorities in Ukraine, while leveraging the scale of UK loan guarantee assistance.
In this instance funding will be allocated to support social protection and social service technical assistance in alignment with SPIRIT programme. UK funding will be paid into a World Bank administered trust fund, the Ukraine Relief, Recovery and Reform Multi-Donor Trust Fund. This will facilitate the creation of a new technical assistance instrument that targets agreed upon reform, while also aligning with UK loan guarantees support and its focus on fiscal support</narrative>
  </description>
